{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/c5b09e9e6abd07ecec3a21c5e8e95cf9.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1368 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/db8692ed1aa2dcda700aebc103b765c2.poster.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/db8692ed1aa2dcda700aebc103b765c2.webm?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/db8692ed1aa2dcda700aebc103b765c2.mp4?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About AETHUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Maeve</strong>, ex-mining engineer for the <i><strong>Astral Resource Corporation</strong></i>\u00a0- <strong>ARC</strong> - a galactic megacorp that profits by <strong>draining entire planets of their resources</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you take on your own mining claim</strong>, you'll explore the remnants of <strong>a doomed science expedition</strong> and the <strong>abandoned facilities they've left behind</strong>\u00a0as Maeve strives to build\u00a0a stable life of her own, <strong>outside of ARC\u2019s control</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but her <strong>basic mining equipment</strong>, tales from her <strong>beloved grandad</strong>, and <strong>her loyal AI drone companion</strong>, can you unravel the mystery of an <strong>incredibly powerful new element </strong>and uncover the <strong>dark secrets</strong> that <strong>the corpos would rather keep buried?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/42cdad07f08eb62dd2645512d389df13.webp?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.poster.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.webm?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.mp4?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/82a500f16cd205843fd10b6a25c91331.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1368 height=130 /></span>Use the\u00a0<strong>simple but powerful</strong> modular building system to create your own <strong>mining operations hub</strong> filled with <strong>dozens of types of refining, processing and crafting stations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow plants, raise fish and prospect for gems</strong> in your cozy habitats which you can <strong>decorate with almost any item you come across</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/84e5e3ae9b58dad954c8c47dde0105f0.webp?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/603a0b470b727f21ca64700cde096673.avif?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ca3234eec3d0655b33c5f5c1c998fe7b.poster.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ca3234eec3d0655b33c5f5c1c998fe7b.webm?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ca3234eec3d0655b33c5f5c1c998fe7b.mp4?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/26b0056572eb4d3a6974014fa920c95b.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1368 height=130 /></span>Descend underground and use lasers, explosives, drills and more to gather <strong>hundreds of different resources</strong> from your mining claim then <strong>refine them</strong> and <strong>craft new tools</strong> for exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade\u00a0your\u00a0suit\u00a0and\u00a0mining\u00a0drone\u00a0companion</strong>\u00a0to explore deeper and further into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/30e36b90e1752fc56b738cb32e5fe5f4.avif?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/51e84226174dc3c48328f3ca36a0a8a6.avif?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/10527e7cc009f21b1163f006fce07aef.poster.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/10527e7cc009f21b1163f006fce07aef.webm?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/10527e7cc009f21b1163f006fce07aef.mp4?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0f53855a931cbc089d046179163c6b15.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1368 height=130 /></span><strong>Built from the ground-up with story at its heart</strong>, uncover a <strong>dystopian corporate conspiracy</strong> and <i>decide how far</i><strong> </strong><i>you\u2019re willing to go for the truth</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story is not an afterthought in AETHUS - there's always new narrative to drive you forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/84e5e3ae9b58dad954c8c47dde0105f0.webp?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/e83ac53ee0879d670fbd1e8115bdbd4f.webp?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/95f213d9ed71430d91835e6b99cbc0b0.poster.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/95f213d9ed71430d91835e6b99cbc0b0.webm?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/95f213d9ed71430d91835e6b99cbc0b0.mp4?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/2a61f012838309c59174918b7163578f.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1368 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a <strong>laid-back exploration experience</strong>? Maybe a\u00a0<strong>hardcore survival challenge</strong>? Want to <strong>mix and match?</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the available\u00a0<strong>Game Modifiers</strong>\u00a0to set up <strong>your</strong> <strong>perfect game settings</strong>, then\u00a0<strong>adjust them at any time while playing.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0205da48a5899d725bf68fb9806d8d46.webp?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/01ef538772deed5a5a9eb10b41cf64be.webp?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: ce