ng>incredibly powerful new element </strong>and uncover the <strong>dark secrets</strong> that <strong>the corpos would rather keep buried?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/42cdad07f08eb62dd2645512d389df13.webp?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.poster.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.webm?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/f8cbd14cbfb7b2d13da1dd1cd0b176d4.mp4?t=1772637326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/82a500f16cd205843fd10b6a25c91331.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1368 height=130 /></span>Use the\u00a0<strong>simple but powerful</strong> modular building system to create your own <strong>mining operations hub</strong> filled with <strong>dozens of types of refining, processing and crafting stations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow plants, raise fish and prospect for gems</strong> in your cozy habitats which you can <strong>decorate with almost any item you come across</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset