72deed5a5a9eb10b41cf64be.webp?t=1772637326\" width=610 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/92512865894732c3d57a3723115adc8b.avif?t=1772637326\" width=459 height=285 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/2bbc2b3eeade98662c642cd201db6bc7.avif?t=1772637326\" width=1368 height=130 /></span><strong>AETHUS</strong> is being created by <i>Pawsmonaut Games</i> - a <strong>solo-indie</strong> developer based in <i>Edinburgh, Scotland</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am self-published, self-funded, and fully committed to old-fashioned <i>ethical</i> game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No use of AI, no early access, no microtransactions or purchaseable cosmetics.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please wishlist the game if it looks interesting to you - it really helps!</p>","developers":["Pawsmonaut Games"],"dlc":[4235910,4235920],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/9b9b970d656422b85c7914cd48525086e3990754/header.jpg?t=1772637326","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"AETHUS Copyright Pawsmonaut Games 2023-6","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2541530/1664701105/6f6d7966fc55c187c8c184304863c1e0acb9540e/1771681754/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771687253","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2541530/1664701105/6f6d7966fc55c187c8c184304863c1e0acb9540e/1771681754/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771687253","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://vide